# identity.bot -- which thread runs a Botlish program
# (MACOS-GRAPHICAL-MAIN-THREAD-CENSUS.md, section 3): the fixture's report
# at the program's first instruction, and its answers as the value --
# [pthread_main_np(), [NSThread isMainThread], the process's thread count].
# No SDL call: the identity of the thread, before any library has an
# opinion about it.
import probe

entry = probe::mark(0)
[entry, probe::ns_is_main(), probe::threads()]
